    "So the region you measure on vsim (between `enter_vsim` and `exit_vsim`)\n",
    "MUST be:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Single privilege level throughout (M, S, or U -- the real level is\n",
    "  transported since L6 was resolved 2026-06-13; the engine's RTL must\n",
    "  implement it, or the resume aborts loudly. No privilege CHANGE inside\n",
    "  the ROI: that is a trap or an xRET, both outside the envelope)\n",
    "- No virtual memory / paging (satp is at reset = bare mode)\n",
    "- Trap-free (no exceptions, no interrupts, no ebreak)\n",
    "- PMP-static (no memory-protection setup is carried in)\n",
    "- No semihosting (exception: the vplat runtime's MMIO-backed\n",
    "  stdio / exit / file io is supported inside the ROI, see L1)\n",
    "- No atomics that cross the handoff boundary\n",
    "- No MMIO other than the vplat device set, UART2 + SimControl/HTIF (see L9)\n",
    "\n",
    "If the measured region steps outside this envelope, the result is silently\n",
    "wrong or the run hangs. Each case is listed below."
   ]
